5.alert
=================
What is alert?
-------------------
While submitting form or perform some action we might get window from app/browser
for confirmation that is called Alert window
- Selenium wont direct handle it we need to write automation script to handle alert
- Selenium support Alert interafce using this interface we can automate alert
- selenium driver has to switch to alert window then as per type of alert we can handle it

Types Of alert
=================
1.Simple alert with (OK button)
2.Confirmation Alert (Ok +Cancel)
3.Prompt alert

Alert interface provides 4 methods
----------------------------------------
1.To get the text of alert                     : getText()
2.To simulate action of OK button              : accept()
3.To simulate action of cancel button          : dismiss()
4.To Handle prompt alert where we send the data: sendKeys()


If alert is not handled then you will get exception
---------------------------------------------------
UnhandledAlertException: unexpected alert open: {Alert text : Please enter your password}

